 "query CG_in_reference: read ~~ over refr CG (span 2). The widest query in the run spans 6,"
 "so by default each read end gets 6 pad columns, the widest span (--end-context)."

 column        pad   pad   pad   pad   pad   pad   read  read  read  ...   read  read  pad   pad   pad   pad   pad   pad  
